                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5b817ec-36c4-3882-b1be-54f6b20fb133",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa12531-1a45-313c-95ec-ea19d9c909f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of five equal parts of a whole: one-fifth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e64b938d-761e-38ec-81d6-13b197952fc1",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa12531-1a45-313c-95ec-ea19d9c909f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A quantity of liquor equal to one-fifth of an American gallon, or, more commonly, 750 milliliters (that is, three quarters of a liter)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1829c13c-fcf9-37a6-88db-561aa0d18b6a",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa12531-1a45-313c-95ec-ea19d9c909f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The musical interval between one note and another five scale degrees higher (the fifth note in a scale)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74a11e8b-5073-495d-ad22-7cf7183141e3",
                                                "sense_id": "1829c13c-fcf9-37a6-88db-561aa0d18b6a",
                                                "text": "Now I've heard there was a secret chord / That David played, and it pleased the Lord / But you don't really care for music, do ya? / It goes like this, the fourth, the fifth"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04fb5d76-7b1e-3db9-a2d5-36e51d7f21af",
                                        "entry_id": "2fa12531-1a45-313c-95ec-ea19d9c909f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fifth voice in a polyphonic melody."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fifth",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7944bab-57cf-3c21-a69d-c4c9c26f9ff8",
                                        "entry_id": "359e32c5-73a6-34b6-9682-a7db51810c63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sing in the fifth voice in a polyphonic melody."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "078e560a-d474-48df-8719-4612cd622538",
                                                "sense_id": "f7944bab-57cf-3c21-a69d-c4c9c26f9ff8",
                                                "text": "Another extension of strict organum is 'fifthing'. Fifthing is a note-against- note method of creating a two-part texture by improvising a second voice over the given tune, starting and ending each musical phrase at the octave and proceeding mainly in fifths above the tune at others times."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a16990dc-b158-44db-8d14-c512fe8df7d1",
                                                "sense_id": "f7944bab-57cf-3c21-a69d-c4c9c26f9ff8",
                                                "text": "Each of these three groups contributes some special insight into the nature of fifthing and the context in which it was practiced."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79f81ddd-47b2-3fb9-862a-e8647a28360f",
                                        "entry_id": "359e32c5-73a6-34b6-9682-a7db51810c63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To support something fifth, after four others have already done so."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e5000a8-4b2d-4c6d-ac52-f1c9edb83996",
                                                "sense_id": "79f81ddd-47b2-3fb9-862a-e8647a28360f",
                                                "text": "Though seconding (or fifthing) the praise for “BoJack Horseman” and “In Treatment,” I think I’ll use the majority of my space to discuss “You’re the Worst.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65b8eada-dbbb-3809-ba2f-fa0d890d3684",
                                        "entry_id": "359e32c5-73a6-34b6-9682-a7db51810c63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To divide by five."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "nonstandard",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95960f6f-965c-438f-bd85-6c7fad063ffb",
                                                "sense_id": "65b8eada-dbbb-3809-ba2f-fa0d890d3684",
                                                "text": "3/5 has been through fifthing. 2/3 has been through thirding. Therefore, 3/5 now needs thirding and 2/3 needs fifthing"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5915effd-5c5d-4e8a-85a9-d9de33053745",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff8be482-d115-3a47-a9c2-07347361fc2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f6d39bab-2beb-320c-aee2-8f211eb49b45",
                        "source_sense_description": "kwint",
                        "target_lang_word": "quinte",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quinte",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b17a176a-9cf4-3841-97f2-658e4d222941",
                                        "entry_id": "ef3911b7-1592-326f-9031-1b1fc891b3ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intervalle de cinq notes consécutives, y compris les deux extrêmes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7752cc1-c9d5-473c-abaf-5077c6e1fa2b",
                                                "sense_id": "b17a176a-9cf4-3841-97f2-658e4d222941",
                                                "text": "La quinte proprement dite est une consonance parfaite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1aabccd8-4623-43de-8fc1-b495799b3ce5",
                                                "sense_id": "b17a176a-9cf4-3841-97f2-658e4d222941",
                                                "text": "La quinte diminuée et la quinte augmentée sont des dissonances."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb7de6e3-b88a-4c23-a028-4807589cbdaa",
                                                "sense_id": "b17a176a-9cf4-3841-97f2-658e4d222941",
                                                "text": "— La seconde corde à gauche de l’instrument devant donner le la au diapason normal, les autres cordes doivent être accordées de façon à ce qu’elles donnent les notes de quinte en quinte, c’est-à-dire sol, quatrième corde ; ré, troisième corde ; la, deuxième corde ; mi, première corde ou chanterelle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1452811f-0281-3b20-8efb-431fbb7e47b5",
                                        "entry_id": "ef3911b7-1592-326f-9031-1b1fc891b3ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suite non interrompue de cinq cartes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Cartes à jouer"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a29376c-caa4-40d1-bbe6-d850e51c5751",
                                                "sense_id": "1452811f-0281-3b20-8efb-431fbb7e47b5",
                                                "text": "Quinte majeure. Avoir quinte et quatorze."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60fa7f3b-a606-3282-9a68-30a3816a38c6",
                                        "entry_id": "ef3911b7-1592-326f-9031-1b1fc891b3ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cinquième garde."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b2f81fa-4436-4223-9dca-0299b74fd48b",
                                                "sense_id": "60fa7f3b-a606-3282-9a68-30a3816a38c6",
                                                "text": "Commencer de prime et achever de quinte."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                        "entry_id": "ef3911b7-1592-326f-9031-1b1fc891b3ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accès de toux violent et prolongé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f61eeae2-8182-46fe-aff6-01f94e19f0f0",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "Une quinte de toux. Il a eu toute la nuit des quintes très pénibles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e1d57aa-f6af-4caa-bd8f-03802fc50c6c",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "Et elle n’oubliait point son éternelle toux, semblable au grincement d’un essieu mal huilé, toux de théâtre cherchant les notes de poitrine à la fin de ses quintes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da194c14-e608-402f-be37-240373f5f213",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "Le bonhomme voulut bien rire de cette plaisanterie, ce qui lui donna une terrible quinte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8053796d-8f16-4a57-8c0d-f7f8dc009ffe",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "On entend tousser violemment, au-dehors.\nBlanche – Ah ! j’entends le marquis.\nGargaret – Je reconnais sa quinte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a4624c8-f476-4fdf-ab23-a0f1f5c84dab",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "Il haussa les épaules, et cet effort amena une nouvelle quinte de toux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b84a69dc-0352-451c-82c4-e427b98c5fd6",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "Et, tout à coup, je vis deux visages, trois visages. Et je compris que je pleurais. Le garçon s’était éloigné, et moi je pleurais, sans un sanglot, sans une quinte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12a26e62-e484-4566-bc9b-1e324b71b660",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "À cette annonce, Paul fut sais d’un accès de rire en trois quintes si violentes qu’elles dévièrent une bouchée de sardines à la tomate, et je crus qu’il allait périr sous nos yeux ; mais quelques tapes dans le dos lui permirent de retrouver sa respiration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44a1606b-a4d4-4f94-9245-59eb093066d7",
                                                "sense_id": "0e1ede05-dadb-3bbf-8de1-294694a84f52",
                                                "text": "Comme toujours, une quinte de toux le secoua, l’obligeant à se lever pour cracher dans le foyer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f9b8b0a-6998-354c-a6b9-4d66d6dc1242",
                                        "entry_id": "ef3911b7-1592-326f-9031-1b1fc891b3ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caprice, bizarrerie, accès de mauvaise humeur qui prend tout d’un coup."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee64c204-1c99-497f-8f96-7ef08aecd2c4",
                                                "sense_id": "9f9b8b0a-6998-354c-a6b9-4d66d6dc1242",
                                                "text": "Il est sujet à des quintes, à des quintes d’humeur. Je ne sais quelle quinte lui a pris."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
